{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">XII Century: Sir Galgano was confined in prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After apparition of Saint Michael, he is called upon to eradicating evil that is raging in the soul and human mind subdued by ecclesiastical authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Struggle against merciless and bloodthirsty enemies in medieval/dark fantasy environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sir Galgano is a side-scrolling medieval beat \u2018em up game with RPG elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game places the player in control of the hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game drew comparisons to the character The King of Dragons, Rastan Saga, Knights of the Round and Golden Axe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game focuses on the hero, Sir Galgano Guidotti, well-know as Saint Galgano. Player battle the game\u2019s many dangers with weapons and complete quests to acquire experience points, which is used to increase Sir Galgano\u2018s abilities and purchase equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress is made through the game by slashing your way through enemy\u2019s forces in dynamic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_8_Fatality.gif?t=1746647975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_4_Fatality.gif?t=1746647975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_3_Fatality.gif?t=1746647975\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parry, roll, dodge and attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He has a variety of weapons, a longsword, a shield and a two-handed sword: there are three modes of attack and many fencing techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_2_Fight.gif?t=1746647975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_6_Fight.gif?t=1746647975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_5_Fight.gif?t=1746647975\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player earn experience points by completing missions. When a player earns enough experience, Sir Galgano\u2019s level increases and the player receives ability points. These points may be used on skill trees and general upgrades have a variety of functions, from raising Sir Galgano\u2019s vitality to improving fencing techniques and activate magic skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/2023_03_07_skill_GIF.gif?t=1746647975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_7_Magia.gif?t=1746647975\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1765250?t=1746647975","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746647975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746647975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746647975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Sir Galgano \u2013 A Medieval Tale contains strong language, intense violence, blood, and gore."},"demos":[{"appid":2420840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Steam Curator</h1><p><strong>Indie Recommendations</strong><br><i>&quot;Sir Galgano Medieval Tale: Early Preview, Has a solid foundation to build of with a great combat system makes battling the enemies with ease and a focus on adventure adds for an immersive experience.&quot;</i><br><br><br><strong>The Paladin Club</strong><br><i>&quot;SG-AMT (pre alpha review) has a lot of potential! I love the atmosphere of the game, but controls are weird and the flow of the game is not smooth. I look forward to coming back for more after polish!&quot;</i><br></p><br><h1>Reviews</h1><p><i>&quot;Sir Galgano - Of Swords and Crosses&quot;</i><br><strong><u>Brawler's Alley</u></strong><br><br><br><i>&quot;Sir Galgano A Medieval Tale: alla scoperta del 'Golden Axe italiano'&quot;</i><br><strong><u>Everyeye</u></strong><br><br><br><i>&quot;Sir Galgano \u2013 A Medieval Tale puts a Golden Axe twist on an iconic Catholic saint&quot;</i><br><strong><u>Niche Gamer</u></strong><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">XII Century: Sir Galgano was confined in prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After apparition of Saint Michael, he is called upon to eradicating evil that is raging in the soul and human mind subdued by ecclesiastical authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Struggle against merciless and bloodthirsty enemies in medieval/dark fantasy environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sir Galgano is a side-scrolling medieval beat \u2018em up game with RPG elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game places the player in control of the hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game drew comparisons to the character The King of Dragons, Rastan Saga, Knights of the Round and Golden Axe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game focuses on the hero, Sir Galgano Guidotti, well-know as Saint Galgano. Player battle the game\u2019s many dangers with weapons and complete quests to acquire experience points, which is used to increase Sir Galgano\u2018s abilities and purchase equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress is made through the game by slashing your way through enemy\u2019s forces in dynamic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_8_Fatality.gif?t=1746647975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_4_Fatality.gif?t=1746647975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_3_Fatality.gif?t=1746647975\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parry, roll, dodge and attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He has a variety of weapons, a longsword, a shield and a two-handed sword: there are three modes of attack and many fencing techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_2_Fight.gif?t=1746647975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_6_Fight.gif?t=1746647975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_5_Fight.gif?t=1746647975\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player earn experience points by completing missions. When a player earns enough experience, Sir Galgano\u2019s level increases and the player receives ability points. These points may be used on skill trees and general upgrades have a variety of functions, from raising Sir Galgano\u2019s vitality to improving fencing techniques and activate magic skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/2023_03_07_skill_GIF.gif?t=1746647975\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/extras/GIF_7_Magia.gif?t=1746647975\" /></p>","developers":["La Fucina del Granducato"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1765250/header.jpg?t=1746647975","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257037617,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037617/movie480.mp4?t=1720867218","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037617/movie_max.mp4?t=1720867218"},"name":"Audio","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257037617/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1720867218","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037617/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1720867218","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037617/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1720867218"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256931342,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256931342/movie480.mp4?t=1720867222","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256931342/movie_max.mp4?t=1720867222"},"name":"Trailer pre alpha","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256931342/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1720867222","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256931342/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1720867222","max":"http://video